<title>CHINA: Swank posts HK$564 mln loss in year net.</title>
<headline>Swank posts HK$564 mln loss in year net.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   157.3 loss  vs  13.7 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  495.94 loss vs  4.10 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    564.35 loss vs  48.74 gain</p>
<p>    Turnover		     778.27	vs  785.38</p>
<p>    Company name		 Swank International Manufacturing</p>
<p>				     Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Swank International Manufacturing makes eye care goods.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss is mainly due to write-off of deposit paid on projects, closure of subsidiaries and provision for deposit of a property investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
